sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Candidate
  participant UI as Voice UI
  participant H as HCVE
  participant STT as STT Adapter
  participant IV as Interview API
  participant G as LangGraph
  participant TTS as TTS Adapter
  U->>UI: Grant mic consent
  UI->>H: Authenticated voice session
  U->>UI: Speak
  UI->>H: Audio frames + sequence
  H->>STT: Audio stream
  STT-->>UI: Partial transcript (provisional)
  STT-->>UI: Final transcript
  UI->>IV: Confirmed answer + idempotency key
  IV->>G: Evaluate committed answer
  G-->>IV: Next committed interviewer text
  IV->>TTS: Synthesize committed text
  TTS-->>UI: Audio response
  U->>UI: Interrupt
  UI->>H: Cancel current turn
  H-->>UI: Discard stale output by fencing token
